WEBVTT

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.500
Hey! What are you doing!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.610
Give it back!

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.500
That's my snack!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.640
Just let it be.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.510
Just pretend that you 
gave it to a cute girl.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:17.080
It's bad behavior for a pet 
to steal its master's snack!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.780
You need to be disciplined!

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.970
What's that noise?

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.940
Last week you made different noises!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.250
Hey, give it back! Give it back!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.560
He's on the same level as a beast.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.130
So, I have a suggestion to make.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.670
If it's abandoning this thing, I'm in.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.410
That's not it. That's our new friend.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.280
What do you guys feel when calling

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.360
our new friend "beast" or "thing"?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.550
That's what I am doing.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.350
No, that's not what I was getting at.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.060
You mean we should give it a name.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.770
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.980
We should name it Beast.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:54.020
Princess, it's cute, isn't it?

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.350
I suppose it is.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.680
Then please give it a cute name.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.780
Gagaronpew.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:00:59.900
Pardon?

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.540
Gagaronpew. That's cute right?

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.040
Hey, give it back! Give it back!

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.080
How about giving it the 
a name of a flower?

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.550
What about giving it the name 
of a goddess from a legend?

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.740
It's Gagaronpew.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.440
Wait, wait, wait!

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.050
Don't be so hasty!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.870
I know some people who named 
their daughter Antoinette.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.920
There's no mistaking 
that she's Japanese.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.870
On top of that, she looks 
just like her father,

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:26.100
definitely not like an Antoinette.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.010
Her mother keeps mispronouncing

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:30.460
her name as Antwaneh.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:31.900
And the characters they used are

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:38.490
an

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:38.490
<b>apricot

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.320
apricot, eternity, and then net.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.990
What the hell is up with 
the last character?!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.490
That's not Japanese, that's English!

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.240
So what are you trying to say?

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:46.050
A name defines, so you can't 
just give it a random name.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.010
That means you can't give 
it a fitting name before

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:50.080
you learn who it is 
and what it's like!

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.510
You're right. Lovely-cute!

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:56.190
Don't name it the first 
thing that comes to mind!

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.690
Floflahrlyleaylamorn. 
That means—

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:03.750
Too long! Four syllables!

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.240
It needs to be four syllables or less!

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.020
It's hard to name it with 
that kind of restriction.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:12.800
That's how we used to do it!

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.910
Besides, you want to 
name it without knowing

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.190
if it's a boy or a girl?!

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.050
Oh, you have a point there.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.530
You didn't even think about that?!

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:22.370
Hey, come down.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.640
Show us if you have balls or not!

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.600
And? Were there any?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.660
You think I could tell from that?!

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.890
Come here! Here!

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.600
Don't just eat the snacks!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:38.880
Or you'll be Goemon!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.310
Your name is Goemon!

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.570
It's four syllables!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.780
Isn't that only three?

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.760
Why do you care about that?!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.300
Fine, Pet.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.710
You'll simply be Pet.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.000
No, that's not cute.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:55.530
Pet is what it is. Entry confirmed!

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.280
Oh boy... Shall we go, then?

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.240
Which path are we taking?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.210
I'm thinking of the coastal one.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.330
Oh, so we'll see the sea!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.490
This area is very nice.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.790
Yes, there are lot of 
old families here.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.800
Is that it?

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.170
Yes, that's my family's estate.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.700
Are we going to live here alone?

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.630
Our butler Sebastian will be there.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.040
He'll take care of 
everything, so you don't

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.600
have to worry about anything.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.460
I've been waiting for you, Erec-sama.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:17.650
I'm glad you're safe.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:21.710
When I heard that your honor 
was tarnished in battle...

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.120
I apologize. I made you worry.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.740
Um, is this the butler, Sebastian?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.200
It's my fiancée, Emilia.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.680
Fiancée?!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.170
Erec-sama, who might this be?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.370
He's my subordinate, Variation.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.630
Oh, then you're the one

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:43.090
who saved Erec-sama on the battlefield!

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:46.370
It wasn't just me, 
the others helped, as well.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.090
Thank you so much.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.130
Uh, ah, it was nothing!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.540
Why don't we move inside and talk.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.340
Certainly!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.340
We've been awaiting you, young master.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.630
Thank you, Sebastian.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:06.380
Variation-sama, this will be your room.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.890
Is that lady also living here?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.810
No, she might be his fiancée,

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.740
but they haven't been wed yet.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:19.430
She comes here from her 
own estate every day.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.710
She is a great lady.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.400
No, she is wonderful.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.480
Coming here is a balm 
for my body and heart.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.320
Um, Erec-sama,

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:36.450
this is a salve that has been 
passed down in my family.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.830
I heard that you were wounded.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.960
Where exactly was that?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.140
It's not fully healed yet, right?

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.960
Please show me your wound.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.210
I will apply it for you.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.700
No!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.350
Uh, I'm sorry, Emilia.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:01.730
No, I don't want a ball-less Erec-sama!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.980
Emilia!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:08.860
<i>No, Emilia mustn't find out!</i>

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.330
No, thank you.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.120
Variation! We're going out!

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.460
Erec-sama, I...

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.620
Why aren't you going?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:28.550
Huh? Isn't Emilia-sama coming, too?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:33.620
Pardon me for asking, 
but did something happen?

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:34.650
Nothing happened.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:38.560
Then why does Emilia-sama look so sad?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.520
Because you tried to 
leave her here, right?

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:43.770
Erec-sama...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.710
Young master...

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.190
Emilia!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.190
Yes?

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.070
Let's go together!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.440
Is that all right?

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:53.740
Of course!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:03.570
<i>So should I tell Emilia?</i>

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:08.170
No!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.090
I don't need my balls to love you.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.060
No!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.540
Emilia!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.050
<i>This is no good!</i>

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.850
It's beyond that hill.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.110
This way, then.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.790
Wow, this is amazing!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.280
There are fish here!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.020
He's almost like a child.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.910
How many children would 
you like to have?

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.960
What?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.590
I mean, with me...

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:54.590
<i>Can I have children 
in my current state?</i>

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.090
Well, Erec-sama?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.040
How should I know?

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:03.310
I'm sorry, Erec-sama.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.100
You're right, children aren't 
born based on wishes alone.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.480
Children are a blessing from the heavens.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:10.390
<i>Ball-essing!</i>

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.770
Erec-sama?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:33.380
God! What am I supposed 
to tell Emilia?!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.640
Emilia-sama?

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.980
How exactly was Erec-sama wounded?

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.710
To be honest, we don't know either.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:47.450
I believe he simply did 
not wish us to worry.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.080
I see.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.530
Please don't worry.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.830
I'm sure Erec-sama will be well again.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:55.520
Once his wounds have healed,

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:58.660
I am sure he will want to settle 
the score with DT once and for all!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.220
DT?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:03.080
He's the one who wounded Erec-sama.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:05.430
Well, I was actually
 defeated by him, as well.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.340
He suddenly fell from the sky.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.170
From the sky?

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:15.120
He uses strange moves, and 
Erec-sama was also taken off guard.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.790
Damn you, DT!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.310
What are you doing right now?!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.250
A carriage... It looks 
like someone's here.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.320
You're late, Erec.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.070
Long time no see, Limpus, Gabriella!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.960
Miss Emilia was with you, too?

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.000
You're as beautiful as ever.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.200
Erec-sama, are you all right?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.340
Please tell us, Erec.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.260
What kind of person 
was able to beat you?

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.220
There's not much to tell.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.730
Erec-sama,

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.800
I've brought you some of the 
Dascas family's secret medicine.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.720
I don't need medicine.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:04.100
If you brew this and drink it, 
any wound will be healed.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.630
I just need to drink it?

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.400
Yes.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.770
I'll gladly accept it.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:15.660
Then I'll bring you a 
freshly brewed cup later.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.430
Hey, Sebastian, please 
make dinner early.

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:20.770
Certainly.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.010
Who are they?

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:25.970
They are Erec-sama's distant relatives,

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.870
Limpus-sama and his 
sister Gabriella-sama.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.770
Actually, the Dascas 
family has been remarkably—

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.370
I'll be going now.

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:35.170
Please wait.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.070
Don't tell us you're 
going home, Miss Emilia.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.800
You should stay here, as well.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.000
He said "as well."

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.800
That's how he is.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.680
We all need to liven this 
place up and cheer up Erec.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.180
Yes, exactly!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.090
Sebastian, get us some alcohol, as well.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.570
He said "as well."

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:56.820
Then please wait a moment 
while I prepare your meal.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.400
The medicine passed down 
in the Dascas family

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.040
is not for wounds.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:12.210
It does perk up a certain 
part that gets hard,

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.630
hard as a bone, bone, boner.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.770
That's vulgar, brother.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.620
Vulgar or not, the future

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:21.290
of the Dascas family lies in your hands.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.110
First you seduce Erec, and then

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.850
you marry into the Dukakis family.

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.760
That's vulgar, brother.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.140
That was not vulgar.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.130
If you seduce Erec,

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:35.910
I will gently console the 
heartbroken Miss Emilia,

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.400
conquer her heart, and marry her.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.080
Sister, I pray that you will succeed.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.400
As do I, brother.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:47.530
If it won't bloom, make the 
chestnut blossoms bloom.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.520
That's vulgar, brother.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.480
This has quite the intense smell.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.120
That means it'll work that much better.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:09.050
I hope it really will work.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.600
It'll work better if you lie down.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.560
I see.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.430
What are you doing, Gabriella?

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:25.820
My body feels kind of hot.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.570
Stop doing things that could 
give the wrong impression.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.770
Maybe it's not wrong...

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:36.270
I've always thought

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.910
you were...

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.050
Stop it, Gabriella!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.190
Cool your head!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.380
Please don't leave, Erec-sama!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.410
Go back to your room.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:48.660
Ow, that hurts!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.470
That hurts, Erec-sama!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.190
I'm sorry, I didn't think I 
put that much force into it.

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.810
You're horrible, Erec-sama.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.020
What's going on, Gabriella?!

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:03.270
Oh my god, what is this?

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:05.070
I hope you'll take 
responsibility for this!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.680
Erec-sama!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.070
Did something happen?

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.790
Erec-sama

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.910
roughed me up.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.420
Emilia-sama!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.140
If she needs treatment, 
I will call for someone.

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.630
Do you think that will be enough

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.320
after you laid hands on my sister?

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.680
You're blowing it out of proportion, 
I just grabbed her wrist.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.660
You think anybody will believe that

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.180
after you drank the medicine?

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.100
Do you even have any balls?!

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.520
<i>Balls...</i>

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:43.370
So that means you want to 
settle this with the sword.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.500
A duel? So be it.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.910
If I win, I'll have you accept that

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.610
both Gabriella and my 
honor were untainted.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.830
If I win, I'll have you 
take responsibility!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.220
I'll be waiting at the Misty 
Woods tomorrow morning!

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:58.580
Gabriella, we're leaving.

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:01.960
Wait, brother!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.450
Don't leave me here.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.090
So he really didn't touch you.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.140
Not at all.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.830
It's unbelievable.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.600
I gave him so many opportunities.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:20.670
I guess the rumors of him having 
an iron will are true.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.080
It was right that we 
decided to have a duel.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.920
But what are you going to do?

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.860
Can you win against him?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:32.360
He cares deeply about honor, 
but I couldn't care less.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.870
You're so great, brother.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.760
Tomorrow is the day the Dascas 
family makes a glorious comeback.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.310
Those bastards...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.000
Erec-sama!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.400
Those guys were scheming 
from the beginning!

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.780
They wanted to seduce and trick you!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.540
All because their family 
faced difficult times!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.020
I figured as much.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:55.760
There's no need to accept this duel!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:16:00.280
No, that's all the more reason 
to settle this with a duel.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.500
Why?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:04.920
There's no denying that I hurt Emilia.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.860
Lord, grant me your protection.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.580
Lord...

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.290
We know of your scheme!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.840
You tried to use your feminine wiles 
to try to marry into his family!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.730
What are you talking about?

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:35.770
Don't play dumb!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.640
Are you trying to run from the duel

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.430
by falsely accusing us of that scheme?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.360
You're the ones making 
false accusations here!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.900
If I win, I'll have you accept 
that nothing happened.

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:49.370
If we win, you'll take responsibility 
by marrying Gabriella.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.540
See, that was your aim all along!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.340
Variation, leave it be.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:54.910
This is my fight.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.300
That's right, winning 
against that youngster

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.530
would do us no good.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.360
You bastard, I knew it!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.330
I have a fiancée.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.130
If you're after my fortune, 
you can have that instead.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.000
How about that?

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:07.790
What should we do?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.150
That's not a bad deal.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.420
You should marry another 
rich guy instead.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:14.260
So the duel's terms are okay, then?

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.430
Yes, I accept them.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.660
Sicoderio-san, please help.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.270
I've come to aid Limpus-dono!

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:25.230
Aid?!

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:30.650
We never said that it wasn't allowed.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.780
Damn you!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.150
No need to interfere, Variation.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.030
I heard that, Erec!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.660
You'll regret those words!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.450
Aguayo-san, please help.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:42.910
I've come to help!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.320
Solitario-san, please help.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.670
I've come to help!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.210
Berasco-san, please help.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.760
Satanico-san, please help.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.780
Bucanero-san, please help.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.630
Gerero-san, please help.

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.890
Cut it out already!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.670
They're just a bunch of goons.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:05.740
Come at me!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.300
Brother, can we win like this?

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.140
Erec is still recovering.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.370
His stamina's got to be limited.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:31.990
Limpus, how about finally 
facing me yourself?

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.320
Gran Exotico-san, please help.

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.430
Gran Exotico-san, please help!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.930
How is this acceptable?!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.660
See, he's getting tired.

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.000
Just one more push.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.280
Erec-sama!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:27.930
I won't lose! 
I can't lose, for Emilia's sake!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.380
Erec-sama!

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.230
No helping allowed!

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:36.670
I didn't think that my stamina

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:37.780
would be affected this much.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.450
Erec-sama!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.740
Emilia!

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:49.370
I believe that you will be victorious!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.980
Wait, I'm your opponent!

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.050
Emilia-sama!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.160
Erec-sama!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.140
Emilia!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.110
This victory is for you!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.240
You're the only one left.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.270
Look, Erec, are you going to 
cut down an unarmed man?

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.510
So you'll admit that this was 
all part of your scheme?

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:47.430
I never said that I give up!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.550
Young master!

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:51.310
How low can you be?!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.330
You lose.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.570
Now hand over your fortune and...

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:00.910
Huh?

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.070
That didn't work!

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:08.580
<i>Why didn't that work?</i>

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.610
Brother!

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:13.080
Hang in there! Brother!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.570
Emilia, this victory belongs to you.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.580
Thank you.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.950
But are you all right, Erec-sama?

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:23.090
For males, that should 
be quite unbearable.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:25.200
Is that so?

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:27.270
It is.

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:30.100
How were you able to 
withstand that last attack?

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.940
I've been training.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:35.090
Is that something you can train?

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.360
Kind of.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.250
Let's go, Emilia.

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:40.410
Of course.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.200
Amazing. You could say 
that's fullmetal.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.310
Fullmetal?

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.520
The Fullmetal Ballchemist...

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.620
So you're leaving again.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.260
I'm sorry.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:56.420
My stamina is worse than I imagined.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:59.240
I'm going to a proper spa to recover.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.380
Will you take this?

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:03.510
Thank you.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.210
No need to worry.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:08.320
My wounds will certainly heal

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.640
with the blessing of the gods.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:13.140
Erec-sama, I will be 
waiting for your return.

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.630
I will definitely return.

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:17.210
When that day comes...

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:18.240
Yes!

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.660
Then we're off.

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:20.980
Please be careful.

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:30.490
Then we have a set destination?

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:33.910
Yes, it's a place where 
the gods congregate.

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:37.350
We're off to the Tamatsukure 
hot springs!

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.600
My name is Mariandel.

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:14.830
My body is male, but in my heart,
 I am a delicate girl.

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:17.010
But my chest is already done.

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:21.020
People always ask why I 
chose the trans life.

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:24.460
There's actually a reason 
that I can't tell anybody...

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:28.900
Kon and the others arrive at a seaside city

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:28.900
and fully enjoy some brief R&R.

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:34.610
what happened in Marian's past.

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:34.660
It is there that Kon discovers
